  NodeID: VillageElderScolding
  SpeakerName: VillageElderScolding
  DialogueText: '"You fool! One should be kind to their mother! Your cat may have
    wandered to the dragon''s lair, if it isn''t in town. I would tell you to be
    careful of the dragon snatching you, but you are a fool, so it seems that warning
    you might be a waste of my breath and wisdom."'
  Choices:
  - ChoiceText: '[Thank you, Elder, for the information. My mother has effectively
      told me the same.]'
